### Ajuste temporal: el martes entra a las 10 y el miércoles descansa (200, calendario del rango)
# La persona recibe el setting 41 con la vigencia del ajuste.
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/saveShiftOverrides
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3096,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23",
  "endDate": "2026-11-29",
  "overrides": [
    { "date": "2026-11-24", "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "date": "2026-11-25", "isDayOff": true }
  ]
}

### Volver a la jornada base en el rango (reset) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/saveShiftOverrides
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3096,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23",
  "endDate": "2026-11-29",
  "reset": true
}

### Franja sin hora de fin → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/saveShiftOverrides
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3096,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23",
  "endDate": "2026-11-29",
  "overrides": [ { "date": "2026-11-24", "startTime": "10:00" } ]
}
